<div class="rug-wrapper rug-relative">
<div class="rug-absolute--bottom-m">
<div class="rug-panel--content">
<span class="rug-panel--content__meta"><strong>Bachelor</strong> - full-time</span>
<h1 class="rug-h2">Liberal Arts and Sciences</h1>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Content -->
<div class="rug-background-white rug-pt">
<div class="rug-wrapper">
<div class="rug-layout rug-layout--l">
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-13-24">
<div class="rug-theme--content">
<div class="rug-theme--content rug-mb">
<div>
<p class="rug-lead">At University College Groningen (UCG), we believe education
should be more than just acquiring knowledge&mdash;it should be a
journey of discovering your academic interests and personal
ambitions.</p>
<div>
                  
<p>Our <strong>Liberal Arts and Sciences</strong> programme is
designed for curious and ambitious students, who want to explore
different disciplines, think critically, and engage with some of
the world's most pressing challenges. At UCG, you will learn in an
<strong>international,</strong>
                     <strong>small-scale and interactive
environment</strong>, where active participation is an essential
part of your education. Our <strong>flexible and interdisciplinary
curriculum</strong> allows you to create a programme tailored to
your interests by freely choosing and combining courses from a wide
range of subjects. A the same time, you will develop greater depth
within a major of your choice: <strong>Humanities,
Sciences,</strong> or <strong>Social Sciences</strong>.</p>
                  
<p>What makes UCG unique? Here, learning goes beyond the classroom.
Through <strong>interdisciplinary projects, real-world
problem-solving, and a global perspective</strong>, you will gain
the skills and confidence to make a meaningful impact. Whether
you're investigating AI and society, or designing sustainable
solutions, your LAS education will be hands-on, and tailored to
your ambitions.</p>
                  
<p>Located in the vibrant student city of
<strong>Groningen</strong>, UCG offers more than just a degree -
it's a community of diverse, motivated individuals ready to shape
the future.</p>
               
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-layout__item rug-width-m-11-24">
<div class="rug-panel rug-panel--callout">
