</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
                              
<p>We offer a February and September intake. For the February
intake, the deadline is 1 November.The deadline for the September
is 1 May.</p>
                           
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="collegegeld-accordion" data-label="Liberal Arts and Sciences" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="tuitionfee">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">Tuition fees</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="tuitionfee"></a>
<div class="rug-clearfix"></div>
<div class="rug-table-wrapper">
<div style="display: none;" class="rug-table-navigator">
<div role="button" data-mode="previous" class="rug-table-navigator__button" aria-label="Navigate to the left">
<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--angle-left"></span>
</div>
<div role="button" data-mode="next" class="rug-table-navigator__button" aria-label="Navigate to the right">
<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--angle-right"></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-table-holder">
<table class="rug-table--default rug-mv-xs">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Nationality</th><th>Year</th><th>Fee</th><th>Programme form</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>EU/EEA</td><td>2026-2027</td><td>&euro;&nbsp;5343</td><td>full-time</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>non-EU/EEA</td><td>2026-2027</td><td>&euro;&nbsp;17200</td><td>full-time</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>EU/EEA</td><td>2027-2028</td><td>&euro;&nbsp;5494</td><td>full-time</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>non-EU/EEA</td><td>2027-2028</td><td>&euro;&nbsp;17200</td><td>full-time</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>University College Groningen is accredited as a small, intensive
teaching provider, and therefore the tuition fees are higher than
for regular Dutch university programmes. The extra investment
ensures small teaching groups and the opportunity to customise your
degree, both of which provide you with an enhanced learning
experience.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>
                           
<p>
                              
<a href="/ucg/application/finances">Find more information on
Tuition fees and estimated Monthly Living and Studying
Costs</a>
                           
</p>
                        
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p>Practical information for:</p>
</div>
<div class="rug-mv">
<a href="/education/bachelor/nederlandse-studenten/" class="rug-button rug-button--medium rug-button--neutral js--analytics rug-mr-xxs rug-w-100__max-m" data-category="collegegeld-nl-ba" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Liberal Arts and Sciences">Dutch students<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs rug-right rug-pt-xxs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><a href="/education/bachelor/international-students/" class="rug-button rug-button--medium rug-button--neutral js--analytics rug-mr-xxs rug-w-100__max-m" data-category="collegegeld-int-ba" data-action="bachelor" data-label="Liberal Arts and Sciences">International students<span class="rug-icon rug-icon--caret-right rug-ml-xs rug-right rug-pt-xxs" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="nastudie-accordion" data-label="Liberal Arts and Sciences" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="afterstudies">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">After your studies</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="afterstudies"></a>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>After three years at UCG, students graduate with a Bachelor of
Arts (BA) or Bachelor of Science (BSc) in Liberal Arts and Sciences
from the University of Groningen. Along the way, they develop the
knowledge, skills and interdisciplinary perspective to pursue their
academic interests and shape their own path after graduation.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>
                           
<p>
                              
<span>Around</span>
                              <span>84% of our graduates continue with a
master's degree</span>
                              <span>, with</span>
                              <span>63% studying at universities ranked
among the global Top 100</span>
                              <span>,
including the University of Oxford, King's College London and Yale
University. Around</span>
                              <span>13% go on to
follow a PhD</span>
                              <span>. Because Liberal
Arts and Sciences is a broad and flexible degree, students can
shape their curriculum around their own interests. As a result, the
master's programmes and career paths our alumni pursue vary widely,
depending on the courses they choose during their bachelor's
degree.</span>
                              <span>Below, you can find
examples of the master's programmes our graduates have enrolled in
and the positions they have taken up after UCG.</span>
                              
<br>
                              
<span>For a more detailed overview, visit
our</span>
                              <span>
                                 <a href="/ucg/about-us/after-ucg">alumni page</a>
                              </span>
                              <span>, where you can find further findings from
our alumni analysis and explore the diverse paths of our graduates
after UCG.</span>
                           
</p>
                           
<p>Examples of Master programme:</p>
                           
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Health and Life Sciences</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">(Clinical) Psychology</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Medicine</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Global Political Economy</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Computational Physics / MPhil Scientific Computing</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Economics, Marketing &amp; Business Management</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">International Relations</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Journalism &amp; Media Studies</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Politics</li>
                              
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Master in Education</li>
                           
</ul>
                        
</div>
</div>
<h2>Job prospects</h2>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>During your time at UCG, you will develop a broad range of
academic and professional skills that prepare you for life after
graduation. Through presentations and discussions during seminars,
you will learn to think critically and communicate your ideas
clearly.</p>
                        
</div>
<div>
                           
<p>Our project-based and interdisciplinary approach gives you the
opportunity to work with fellow students and engage with experts to
explore complex questions and develop solutions to real-world
challenges. You will learn to approach problems from different
perspectives and draw on knowledge from multiple academic
fields.<br>
This combination of academic breadth, interdisciplinary thinking
and practical experience provides a strong foundation for your
future career. <a href="/ucg/about-us/after-ucg">Read more</a>.</p>
                        
</div>
</div>
<h2>Job examples</h2>
<ul class="rug-list--bullets rug-mv-xs">
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Policy Advisor</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Researcher</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Journalist</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Economist</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Psychologist</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Teacher</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Doctor</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Business Development Manager</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Business Analyst</li>
<li class="rug-list--bullets__item">Historian</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rug-accordion--part">
<h2 tabindex="0" class="rug-accordion--toggle js--analytics" data-category="onderzoek-accordion" data-label="Liberal Arts and Sciences" data-action="bachelor" data-anchor="research">
<span class="rug-icon"></span><span class="rug-accordion--toggle-label">Research</span>
</h2>
<div class="rug-accordion--content">
<a id="research"></a>
<div>
<div>
                           
<p>Our small yet dynamic interdisciplinary faculty excels in
boundary-crossing research that addresses real-world challenges.
With a focus on collaboration and innovation, our close-knit
community of scholars spans the sciences, humanities, and social
sciences. We're committed to pushing the boundaries of knowledge,
offering students a unique opportunity to engage in multifaceted
research that spans diverse fields: from solving global issues, to
pioneering advances in technology and the arts.</p>
                        
</div>
<langContainer></langContainer>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
